    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbAbout &quot;HAKONIWA DEFENSE&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;HAKONIWA DEFENSE&quot; is a tower defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, who has lost his memory, cooperates with the girls to defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the protagonist wakes up, he finds himself in a dark forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What on earth was he doing, and why is he here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time to worry. A monster and a strange girl appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please watch to see what the fate of the protagonist and the girls will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbFeatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into a story part and a battle part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the battle part, you start with the preparation phase (placement phase), where you tell the girls where to wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each girl has her own unique way of fighting. The protagonist cannot fight directly, but he can help bring out the best in each girl by considering their individual personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the preparation phase is over, the battle will begin and proceed automatically.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbAbout &quot;HAKONIWA DEFENSE&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;HAKONIWA DEFENSE&quot; is a tower defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, who has lost his memory, cooperates with the girls to defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the protagonist wakes up, he finds himself in a dark forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What on earth was he doing, and why is he here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time to worry. A monster and a strange girl appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please watch to see what the fate of the protagonist and the girls will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbFeatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into a story part and a battle part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the battle part, you start with the preparation phase (placement phase), where you tell the girls where to wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each girl has her own unique way of fighting. The protagonist cannot fight directly, but he can help bring out the best in each girl by considering their individual personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the preparation phase is over, the battle will begin and proceed automatically.</p>",
